    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if i do those things... it doesn't change the truth of it. i look at the stars and i don't see wonder anymore, i just see a graveyard. all this effort, trying to be \"kind\" or \"connect\" with people, it feels like just playing pretend to distract ourselves from the fact that there's no point. it feels like we're just running in circles in a dark room. it's exhausted me. like, why bother building anything if the universe is just waiting to swallow it all up?",
